-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg> Unduh PDF </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1\"><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">Komponen Laporan Keuangan:</span>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-0.5\">\r\n<li>Neraca (Laporan Posisi Keuangan)</li>\r\n<li>Laporan Realisasi Anggaran (LRA)</li>\r\n<li>Laporan Operasional (LO)</li>\r\n<li>Laporan Perubahan Ekuitas (LPE)</li>\r\n<li>Catatan atas Laporan Keuangan (CaLK)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',4,0,'publikasi','2026-10-15 02:41:43','2026-10-15 04:23:38'),(23,'informasi-publik','rencana-strategis','Rencana Strategis','Dokumen perencanaan jangka menengah: visi, misi, tujuan, dan arah kebijakan.','ceklis',NULL,'<div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n            Rencana Strategis (Renstra) Rumah Tahanan Negara Kelas IIB Pandeglang disusun sebagai penjabaran dari Rencana Strategis Direktorat Jenderal Pemasyarakatan dan Rencana Pembangunan Jangka Menengah Nasional (RPJMN) untuk periode lima tahun ke depan, memuat sasaran strategis, indikator kinerja, serta program dan kegiatan prioritas.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Arah Kebijakan Strategis -->\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 text-sm\">Arah Kebijakan Strategis:</span>\n            <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-blue-800 space-y-1\">\n                <li>Peningkatan pelayanan tahanan berbasis hak asasi manusia</li>\n                <li>Penguatan kapasitas pengamanan dan ketertiban dengan pendekatan humanis</li>\n                <li>Optimalisasi pembinaan kepribadian dan kemandirian WBP</li>\n                <li>Peningkatan kualitas SDM aparatur pemasyarakatan yang profesional dan berintegritas</li>\n                <li>Percepatan reformasi birokrasi dan penguatan zona integritas menuju WBK/WBBM</li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tabel Unduh Dokumen Renstra -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xs\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Nama Dokumen</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Periode</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Status</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Aksi Unduh</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Renstra Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang 2025–2029</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">5 Tahun (2025–2029)</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Ditetapkan</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Renstra Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang 2020–2024</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">5 Tahun (2020–2024)</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-gray-200 text-gray-600\">Arsip</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n',5,0,'publikasi','2026-10-15 02:41:43','2026-10-15 02:41:43'),(24,'informasi-publik','iku','IKU (Indikator Kinerja Utama)','Tolok ukur pencapaian sasaran strategis sebagai dasar evaluasi kinerja.','grafik',NULL,'<div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n            Indikator Kinerja Utama (IKU) Rumah Tahanan Negara Kelas IIB Pandeglang ditetapkan berdasarkan Keputusan Menteri dan menjadi acuan dalam mengukur keberhasilan pelaksanaan program serta kebijakan pelayanan pemasyarakatan secara terukur dan akuntabel.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Tabel Capaian IKU -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xs\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Indikator Kinerja</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Target</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Realisasi</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Capaian</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Indeks Kepuasan Layanan Pemasyarakatan</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">85%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">87,5%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">102,9%</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Persentase Penyelesaian Pengaduan Masyarakat</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">100%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">100%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">100%</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Tingkat Keamanan dan Ketertiban UPT</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">95%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">96,8%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">101,9%</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Realisasi Penyerapan Anggaran</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">95%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-600\">93,2%</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-700\">98,1%</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dokumen IKU Unduh -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xs\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Nama Dokumen</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Tahun</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Aksi Unduh</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Dokumen Penetapan IKU Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang Tahun 2025</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">2025</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Dokumen Penetapan IKU Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang Tahun 2024</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">2024</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n',6,0,'publikasi','2026-10-15 02:41:43','2026-10-15 02:41:43'),(25,'informasi-publik','perjanjian-kinerja','Perjanjian Kinerja','Komitmen pencapaian target kinerja terukur pimpinan satuan kerja.','dokumen',NULL,'<div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n            Perjanjian Kinerja (PK) merupakan lembar/dokumen yang berisikan penugasan dari pimpinan instansi yang lebih tinggi kepada pimpinan instansi yang lebih rendah untuk melaksanakan program/kegiatan yang disertai dengan indikator kinerja. Dokumen ini menjadi dasar penilaian keberhasilan/kegagalan pencapaian tujuan dan sasaran organisasi.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Informasi Perjanjian Kinerja -->\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 text-sm\">Sasaran Strategis dalam Perjanjian Kinerja:</span>\n            <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-blue-800 space-y-1\">\n                <li>Meningkatnya kualitas pelayanan perawatan dan pembinaan tahanan</li>\n                <li>Terwujudnya keamanan dan ketertiban yang kondusif di lingkungan rutan</li>\n                <li>Meningkatnya akuntabilitas pengelolaan keuangan dan kinerja instansi</li>\n                <li>Meningkatnya kualitas layanan informasi publik dan transparansi</li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tabel Unduh Dokumen PK -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xs\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Nama Dokumen</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Tahun Anggaran</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Status</th>\n                        <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Aksi Unduh</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Perjanjian Kinerja Kepala Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang Tahun 2025</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">TA 2025</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Ditandatangani</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Perjanjian Kinerja Kepala Rutan Kelas IIB Pandeglang Tahun 2024</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-gray-500\">TA 2024</td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Ditandatangani</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg>\n                                Unduh PDF\n                            </span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">Dasar Hukum:</span>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-0.5\">\n                <li>Peraturan Presiden Nomor 29 Tahun 2014 tentang Sistem Akuntabilitas Kinerja Instansi Pemerintah</li>\n                <li>Peraturan Menteri PAN-RB Nomor 53 Tahun 2014 tentang Petunjuk Teknis PK, Pelaporan Kinerja, dan Tata Cara Reviu atas LAKIP</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n',7,0,'publikasi','2026-10-15 02:41:43','2026-10-15 02:41:43'),(26,'informasi-publik','hasil-survei-spak-spkp','Hasil Survei SPAK/SPKP','Survei persepsi anti korupsi dan kepuasan pelayanan masyarakat.','grafik',NULL,'<div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm\">\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\r\n<p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Rumah Tahanan Negara Kelas IIB Pandeglang secara berkala melaksanakan Survei Persepsi Anti Korupsi (SPAK) dan Survei Penilaian Kepuasan Pelayanan (SPKP) sebagai bagian dari penilaian pembangunan Zona Integritas menuju Wilayah Bebas dari Korupsi (WBK) dan Wilayah Birokrasi Bersih dan Melayani (WBBM).</p>\r\n<!-- Penjelasan Singkat SPAK dan SPKP -->\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\r\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-bold text-red-900 text-sm mb-1\">SPAK</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-red-800 leading-relaxed\">Survei Persepsi Anti Korupsi mengukur persepsi stakeholder terhadap praktik korupsi, gratifikasi, dan integritas pelayanan di lingkungan UPT Pemasyarakatan.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl\">\r\n<h3 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 text-sm mb-1\">SPKP</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-800 leading-relaxed\">Survei Penilaian Kepuasan Pelayanan mengukur tingkat kepuasan pengguna layanan terhadap aspek kecepatan, transparansi, keramahan, dan kualitas pelayanan publik rutan.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Tabel Ringkasan Skor -->\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-xs\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-left\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Jenis Survei</th>\r\n<th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Tahun</th>\r\n<th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Skor / Indeks</th>\r\n<th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Kategori</th>\r\n<th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\">Dokumen</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Survei Persepsi Anti Korupsi (SPAK)</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-500\">2025</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-bold text-gray-900\">3,72 / 4,00</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Sangat Baik</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"> <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg> Unduh </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Survei Kepuasan Pelayanan (SPKP)</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-500\">2025</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-bold text-gray-900\">88,4 / 100</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Sangat Baik</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"> <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg> Unduh </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Survei Persepsi Anti Korupsi (SPAK)</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-500\">2024</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-bold text-gray-900\">3,65 / 4,00</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Baik</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"> <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg> Unduh </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Survei Kepuasan Pelayanan (SPKP)</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center text-gray-500\">2024</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-bold text-gray-900\">85,7 / 100</td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">Baik</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-red-600 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"> <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg> Unduh </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1\"><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">Catatan:</span>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Survei dilaksanakan oleh Tim Penilai Internal (TPI) dan diverifikasi oleh Tim Penilai Nasional (TPN) Kementerian PAN-RB sebagai bagian dari penilaian pembangunan Zona Integritas menuju WBK/WBBM.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',8,0,'publikasi','2026-10-15 02:41:43','2026-10-15 04:24:00');
